points.\n{{Clr}}----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 gifts per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat. Each gift used on a boat will be rewarded with 20 [[holly]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Gift Wrapping Station Products]]\n[[Category:Cookie Products]]\n[[Category:Indigo Products]]\n[[Category:Milk Products]]\n[[Category:Corn Bread Products]]\n[[Category:Apple Products]]\n[[Category:Wool Products]]\n{{Languages\n|de = Schneeflockengeschenk\n|es = Regalo de copo de nieve\n}}",
